-- Self-contained demo dataset for the Findings feature (POC branch poc/FindingPage).
-- Idempotent: every INSERT uses ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING keyed on the row's primary key, so
-- re-running this migration (or running it against a DB that already has this exact demo data)
-- is a no-op. Deliberately does NOT depend on any real exercise/scenario: the Prowler injector
-- and its single standalone inject ("Prowler test scan") are fabricated here specifically so the
-- OCSF/Prowler findings below have a valid finding_inject_id without needing a full exercise.
--
-- Deliberately does NOT reference the bootstrap admin user (User.ADMIN_UUID): that row is only
-- created by InitAdminCommandLineRunner, which runs as a Spring CommandLineRunner AFTER Flyway
-- migrations complete - referencing it here would violate the FK on a fresh database where this
-- migration runs before the admin user exists. finding_triage_history_actor_id and
-- secret_reference_created_by are left NULL ("system-seeded", not attributed to a user); the one
-- demo comment (which requires a NOT NULL author) is intentionally omitted for the same reason.
--
-- Contents: 1 injector (Prowler catalog entry), 1 standalone inject, 5 demo assets (used as
-- Also Detected On "locations"), 16 OCSF/Prowler findings, their asset/triage/triage-history
-- rows, and 5 demo credentials (secrets + secret_references) for the credential test/verify
-- feature.


